OL,3,GNEWSANew book festival launched in city
OL,4,
OL,5,FA new book festival is being launched
OL,6,Fin Stoke-on-Trent to encourage more
OL,7,Fpeople to read and help improve
OL,8,Fliteracy levels.
OL,10,FStoke Book Festival will run between
OL,11,F3-10 October and include talks by
OL,12,Fauthors, workshops and performances.
OL,14,FSimon Drakeford, festival director,
OL,15,Fsaid they wanted to promote books by
OL,16,Fsupporting the brilliant literacy work
OL,17,Falready going on and by having authors
OL,18,Fcome to Stoke.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
