OL,3,GNEWSANew book festival launched in city
OL,4,
OL,5,FData has shown that only 70% of
OL,6,FStoke-on-Trent children meet the
OL,7,Fexpected level of reading by the end of
OL,8,FYear 6, compared with 75% nationally,
OL,9,Fmaking the city the lowest ranked
OL,10,Facross the whole of the West Midlands.
